Formula: `EMA[0] = Close[0] × α + EMA[1] × (1 − α)`  where `α = 2 / (9 + 1) = 0.2000`

**NinjaScript**
```csharp
public class EMA9 : Indicator
{
    private double alpha, beta;

    protected override void OnStateChange()
    {
        if (State == State.SetDefaults)
        {
            Name      = "EMA9";
            IsOverlay = true;
            AddPlot(Brushes.DodgerBlue, "EMA9");
        }
        else if (State == State.Configure)
        {
            alpha = 2.0 / (9 + 1);   // 0.200000
            beta  = 1 - alpha;
        }
    }

    protected override void OnBarUpdate()
    {
        Value[0] = CurrentBar == 0
            ? Input[0]
            : Input[0] * alpha + Value[1] * beta;
    }
}
```

